"
A WarningKeyTheodoliteMobileLabRudesheim is ModelTheodoliteMobileLabRudesheim's dictionary key for
its warning entry, reached as `Rudesheim MobileLab Theodolite Key Warning`. It holds no state -- the
class itself is the key object (matching the project's existing pattern of using classes as
dictionary keys). The entry's value is a plain 0-or-1-element array of message Strings, not an
instance of this class or of any other Theodolite-specific wrapper: this class exists only to be
used as a key. No behavior is defined yet -- see KeyTheodoliteMobileLabRudesheim's comment for the
kind of thing it could later carry.
"
Class {
	#name : 'WarningKeyTheodoliteMobileLabRudesheim',
	#superclass : 'Object',
	#traits : 'TKeyTheodoliteMobileLabRudesheim',
	#classTraits : 'TKeyTheodoliteMobileLabRudesheim classTrait',
	#category : 'Rudesheim-MobileLab-Theodolite',
	#package : 'Rudesheim-MobileLab-Theodolite'
}
